Since the COVID-19 outburrecence there has been an increase of prejudice, xenophobia, and racism focused on people of Chinese or eastern Asian proficiency, and against people from focus zones in Europe, the United States and other countries.
Incidents of fright, mistrust, and hostility have been observed in many countries, especially in Europe, eastern Asia, North America and the Asia-Mifalactic region.
